Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 03:28:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST Economy: LateStrike flag, the book half (economy
 first, then a straight line to the spike, gold saved for the upgrades)

For a candidate warmonger whose spike comes late (not Personality's
bMilitaryFirst) and has a strike plan (CvGrandStrategyAI::GetStrikePlan),
under the new flag LateStrike (off in the bundle; for the next block):
- the normal book and expansion (no city cap);
- research: after the book, from 30 turns (Standard) before the plan's
  window opens to its declare-by turn, the core unit's tech, then the
  plan's upgrade tech (before War's TimingBuildup techs);
- gold: from the build-up (15 turns Standard before the window) to the
  declaration, no hurries (WarChest's siege purchases still run) and no
  tiles, for the upgrade and go;
- policy: the plan's first branch when Personality names one
  (NO_POLICY_BRANCH_TYPE keeps the book's own).
War's half (the late window and the target) can read IsLateStrikeCiv.
On claude/ab-c1 40203a3. Written 10:28pm ET.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZj2nf4FeZTEHWjvnhhA
